WEBVTT

00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:41.667
Kirito.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.667
It's all right. I'll go.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:49.292
After I've rescued the villagers,
I'll come right back.

00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:50.542
Kirito!

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.000
"Raids"

00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:29.125
That's...

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:39.458
Advance! Advance!

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:47.542
Why don't they flee south
where there aren't any enemies?

00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:50.042
Amayori, wait here until I summon you!

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:01.375
If the enemy breaches our line
of defense, use lethal force!

00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:05.625
Listen! Don't let a single one
get this far into the village!

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:18.292
That's...

00:03:30.292 --> 00:03:33.083
We can't possibly defend against them here.

00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:37.125
Please have everyone
take the south road to evacuate!

00:03:37.125 --> 00:03:38.917
Don't be ridiculous!

00:03:38.917 --> 00:03:42.792
Abandon my mansion--
no, I mean the village and run off?

00:03:42.792 --> 00:03:47.708
If you leave now, you can get away
without being caught by the goblins.

00:03:47.708 --> 00:03:51.333
Your possessions or your lives,
which is more important?

00:03:53.042 --> 00:03:56.750
"Form a circle in the plaza,
and tighten up our defenses."

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.292
Those are Chief Man-at-Arms Zink's orders.

00:03:59.292 --> 00:04:04.542
In a situation like this, even I,
the village elder, must follow such orders.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:09.000
That is imperial law.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.292
Let's do as Sister says.

00:04:12.583 --> 00:04:14.000
Father.

00:04:16.542 --> 00:04:18.000
Selka.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.667
Father.

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:25.542
Have you ever once known Sister to be wrong?

00:04:25.542 --> 00:04:28.792
No, even I can tell.

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:30.458
If we don't do something...

00:04:31.417 --> 00:04:33.792
...we'll all be killed!

00:04:33.792 --> 00:04:36.542
Flee?

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:39.500
You're just a child, so stay out of this!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.000
The village must be protected!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.917
I-I see.

00:04:48.917 --> 00:04:50.708
I get it!

00:04:50.708 --> 00:04:55.167
You're the one who let those monsters from the
land of darkness into the village, aren't you, Alice?

00:04:55.167 --> 00:05:00.125
Years ago, when you crossed the End Mountains,
you were tainted by the power of darkness!

00:05:00.125 --> 00:05:01.250
You're a witch!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.792
This girl is a fearsome witch!

00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:10.417
As a knight, I hereby revoke
Chief Man-at-Arms Zink's order.

00:05:10.417 --> 00:05:15.375
I order all villagers gathered in this plaza
to evacuate to the forest south of here,

00:05:15.375 --> 00:05:17.917
with those who are armed in the lead.

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:20.250
K-Knight? What are you talking about?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.583
There's no such Calling in this village!

00:05:23.583 --> 00:05:27.792
Claiming to be a knight just because
you can somewhat handle a sword.

00:05:27.792 --> 00:05:30.750
What would happen if the knights
in the capital heard about this?

00:05:33.417 --> 00:05:35.333
My name is Alice.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.750
I am the overseer of the capital city of Centoria.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:47.333
An Integrity Knight... of the Axiom Church.

00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:49.167
Ranked third!

00:05:49.167 --> 00:05:51.458
Alice Synthesis Thirty!

00:05:54.667 --> 00:05:57.583
I-I-Integrity Knight?

00:06:01.167 --> 00:06:03.292
Sister, you're...?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.625
I'm sorry I kept it from you all this time.

00:06:11.542 --> 00:06:16.667
This is the true penalty I was given,
and my true duty.

00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:20.583
No. I always believed!

00:06:20.583 --> 00:06:24.292
That there was no way
you could be a criminal.

00:06:24.292 --> 00:06:30.250
I shall follow your command,
Lady Integrity Knight.

00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:37.417
Those of you who are armed, take the lead
and guide the villagers to the south gate!

00:06:37.417 --> 00:06:41.875
Once you've left the village,
evacuate to the forest south of the clearing!

00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:45.583
Leave the wounded and the elderly to us!

00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:48.875
We'll lead the others out! Follow us!

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:56.000
Father, please take care of everyone,
and of Selka and Mother.

00:06:56.917 --> 00:06:58.958
Lady Knight.

00:06:58.958 --> 00:07:01.000
Take care as well.

00:07:02.208 --> 00:07:05.167
Sister, don't push yourself, okay?

00:07:06.958 --> 00:07:08.333
Amayori!

00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:19.792
What a horde!

00:07:19.792 --> 00:07:22.750
Retreat! Retreat!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.250
Burn them all!

00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:38.208
N-No way.

00:07:38.208 --> 00:07:40.292
I-Is that Sister's...?

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.000
A dragon?

00:07:51.667 --> 00:07:53.708
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:07:53.708 --> 00:07:55.833
There's no time to explain.

00:07:55.833 --> 00:07:58.208
Please evacuate with the others.

00:07:58.208 --> 00:07:59.250
Hurry!

00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:04.750
I-Ium woman. I'll kill and devour you!

00:08:28.625 --> 00:08:32.792
From now on, I'm going to fight
for what I want to.

00:08:32.792 --> 00:08:35.750
To protect my sister and my parents.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.667
And...

00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:43.583
I will fight to protect the people of the Human
Empire Kirito and Eugeo tried to preserve.

00:08:59.375 --> 00:09:01.458
Thank you, Kirito.

00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:03.250
I'll be fine now.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:08.458
I'm sure I'll still hesitate,
but I'm going to move forward.

00:09:08.458 --> 00:09:12.167
For you, and for what I seek.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.500
I am Alice, knight of the Human Empire!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:21.542
As long as I'm here, you'll never find
the blood and carnage you desire.

00:09:21.542 --> 00:09:25.917
Return through the cave to your homeland!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.958
Enhance Armament!

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:37.625
Out of my way!

00:09:37.625 --> 00:09:43.042
If it's just one little girl,
I, Morikka the Foot Harvester, will--

00:09:43.042 --> 00:09:45.083
Wh-What?

00:09:48.083 --> 00:09:49.750
Storm and churn...

00:09:50.708 --> 00:09:52.125
...my flowers!

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:21.042
This is the wall separating the Human Empire
and the land of darkness!

00:10:21.042 --> 00:10:26.125
Even if you unseal the caves,
as long as we knights exist,

00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:29.000
we will never allow you to corrupt this land!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.083
Make your choice!

00:10:32.083 --> 00:10:34.583
Either advance and fall into a sea of blood,

00:10:34.583 --> 00:10:37.625
or retreat and escape to the land of darkness!

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.417
I'll make you a new doll!

00:10:58.417 --> 00:10:59.833
Yay!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:06.583
I think deep down, Father wanted
to come and see you off.

00:11:06.583 --> 00:11:08.833
I know.

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:12.708
Someday, when I've fulfilled all of my duties,

00:11:12.708 --> 00:11:16.792
I'll come back here as plain Alice Zuberg.

00:11:16.792 --> 00:11:20.250
I think that's when I'll be able to say...

00:11:21.292 --> 00:11:23.792
"Father, I'm home."

00:11:30.833 --> 00:11:34.375
I'll definitely return to this village one day.

00:11:38.708 --> 00:11:43.417
Even if I fall on the battlefield,
my heart definitely will.

00:11:49.792 --> 00:11:52.625
"Monday, July 6, 2026 2:07 PM   Ocean Turtle"

00:12:37.333 --> 00:12:38.083
"Main Control Room Ocean Turtle
33 minutes after the attack"

00:12:38.083 --> 00:12:40.333
"Main Control Room Ocean Turtle
33 minutes after the attack"
Hey! It's deserted.

00:12:40.333 --> 00:12:41.625
"Main Control Room Ocean Turtle
33 minutes after the attack"
Looks like they ran away.

00:12:43.125 --> 00:12:44.750
Where are they?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:50.083
My guess would be...
in the Sub Control Room.

00:12:53.583 --> 00:12:55.417
"Sub Control Room Ocean Turtle
23 minutes after the attack"

00:12:58.208 --> 00:13:00.083
We're connected to the backup power now!

00:13:00.083 --> 00:13:03.458
Now we can use the Sub Control Room.

00:13:08.833 --> 00:13:15.417
If Kirito doesn't regain consciousness,
I will never forgive you as long as I live!

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.542
I know that.

00:13:22.542 --> 00:13:26.708
I'll see to it that Kirito recovers,
no matter what.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.458
It'll be all right.

00:13:33.458 --> 00:13:35.333
I promise you it'll be all right.

00:13:35.333 --> 00:13:38.750
He'll definitely come back to you.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.333
Yes, of course.

00:13:41.333 --> 00:13:44.083
I'm sorry I overreacted.

00:13:47.417 --> 00:13:48.792
Reporting in, sir.

00:13:48.792 --> 00:13:52.000
Confirming that the primary and secondary
bulkheads have been completely sealed,

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:56.917
and that all noncombatants
have been evacuated to the bow block.

00:13:56.917 --> 00:14:00.667
Good work. How long will the bulkheads hold?

00:14:00.667 --> 00:14:07.208
The enemy could break through
with explosives, but that's unlikely.

00:14:07.208 --> 00:14:09.375
Near the primary bulkhead...

00:14:09.375 --> 00:14:12.917
...is the Lightcube Cluster, right?

00:14:12.917 --> 00:14:16.000
All right. Let's sum up the situation here.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.708
Lt. Nakanishi, please report the casualties.

00:14:19.708 --> 00:14:20.792
Yes, sir.

00:14:20.792 --> 00:14:24.708
Minor injuries to three researchers
on the civilian block team.

00:14:24.708 --> 00:14:29.083
Two heavy injuries and two minor
injuries to the Self-Defense Force.

00:14:29.083 --> 00:14:32.208
None of them are life-threatening.

00:14:32.208 --> 00:14:33.792
Any damage to the ship?

00:14:33.792 --> 00:14:38.875
The bulkheads in the passageway from the
bottom dock to the Main Control Room

00:14:38.875 --> 00:14:40.958
can't be controlled remotely.

00:14:40.958 --> 00:14:45.292
Even worse, now that the main
power line has been cut,

00:14:45.292 --> 00:14:50.208
even though the auxiliary line is providing
a stable power supply to all areas,

00:14:50.208 --> 00:14:54.042
we can't rotate the screws
without rebooting the control system.

00:14:54.042 --> 00:14:57.208
Just like a sea turtle without its fins, huh?

00:14:57.208 --> 00:15:00.125
Plus, it's got a shark latched onto its belly.

00:15:00.125 --> 00:15:08.625
Yes. Sectors 1 through 12 in the Lower Shaft...
have all been completely taken over.

00:15:08.625 --> 00:15:13.750
So they've seized Main Control,
STL Room One, and...

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.042
...even the nuclear reactor, huh?

00:15:17.042 --> 00:15:22.750
I guess the silver lining
is that their intention isn't to destroy.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:27.250
The question is, who are these guys?

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.792
Higa, do you have any thoughts?

00:15:29.792 --> 00:15:32.000
Well.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.708
Let's see.

00:15:36.708 --> 00:15:41.625
Going by the color and specs of their gear,
they don't belong to any official army.

00:15:41.625 --> 00:15:46.250
And from their average size,
we can assume that they're not Asian.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:51.042
So at the very least, they're not
with a domestic special forces.

00:15:51.042 --> 00:15:53.958
How lucky for us, huh?

00:15:53.958 --> 00:15:57.250
And there's one more thing
we can say with certainty.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:01.292
These people know about
the existence of Project Alicization.

00:16:01.292 --> 00:16:03.625
Yeah, you got that right.

00:16:03.625 --> 00:16:08.083
I mean, they went straight
to the Main Control Room.

00:16:08.083 --> 00:16:14.208
Which means their goal is the true
bottom-up artificial intelligence.

00:16:14.208 --> 00:16:16.583
To seize A.L.I.C.E.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:21.458
Luckily, we were able to
lock down Main Control in time.

00:16:21.458 --> 00:16:28.417
So now they can't interfere with the simulation
or eject Alice's Fluctlight from the cluster.

00:16:28.417 --> 00:16:31.667
But the same goes for us, right?

00:16:31.667 --> 00:16:33.208
Well, yeah, that's right.

00:16:33.208 --> 00:16:38.708
It's no longer possible to use commands
to eject Alice's Lightcube externally.

00:16:38.708 --> 00:16:43.458
But Mr. Kiku, at this point,
wouldn't you call this a win?

00:16:43.458 --> 00:16:48.917
I mean, they can't access the cluster
by physical or informational means.

00:16:48.917 --> 00:16:52.167
So now if our escort ship
sends some reinforcements,

00:16:52.167 --> 00:16:55.750
I'm telling you, it's game over. Game over!

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:59.208
Not that we know what kind of game it is.

00:16:59.208 --> 00:17:01.583
And that's the problem.

00:17:01.583 --> 00:17:04.000
Tell me, will the Asahi take action?

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.292
Well, about that...

00:17:07.583 --> 00:17:10.458
The Asahi was ordered by
Fleet Command in Yokosuka

00:17:10.458 --> 00:17:14.208
to stand by and maintain its current distance.

00:17:14.208 --> 00:17:19.750
They've determined that we've been taken
hostage by our attackers, it seems.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:26.125
Most likely, those men in black have a
back channel to the top brass in the SDF.

00:17:26.125 --> 00:17:32.042
There won't be an order for the Asahi to attack
until after Alice's Lightcube has been secured.

00:17:32.042 --> 00:17:36.167
Meaning that those guys aren't just terrorists?

00:17:36.167 --> 00:17:37.708
This could be bad.

00:17:37.708 --> 00:17:41.375
If they have any experts on their side,
they might figure it out.

00:17:41.375 --> 00:17:44.792
An operation within the Underworld, huh?

00:17:44.792 --> 00:17:48.125
Now that they've taken control
of STL Room One,

00:17:48.125 --> 00:17:53.250
they can certainly execute commands via
the virtual console installed in the Underworld.

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:56.792
What will happen if they do?

00:17:56.792 --> 00:18:02.833
The target cube will be extracted from the Lightcube
Cluster in the center of the Main Shaft,

00:18:02.833 --> 00:18:07.458
and transported via air tube
to the chosen control room.

00:18:07.458 --> 00:18:09.667
There's an extraction hatch there.

00:18:09.667 --> 00:18:12.958
And of course, there's one
in the Main Control Room, as well.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:21.542
We're going to retrieve Alice's Fluctlight
from the Underworld before they can.

00:18:21.542 --> 00:18:24.708
The only one who can do that is Kirito.

00:18:24.708 --> 00:18:29.958
In other words, our last hope
rests on his shoulders.

00:18:29.958 --> 00:18:33.583
Higa, tell us. What's Kirito's condition?

00:18:34.792 --> 00:18:37.167
To be concise...

00:18:37.167 --> 00:18:42.458
...he's teetering on the edge
of the worst-case scenario.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:53.833
The assault by the last Death Gun member
left Kirito with damage to his neural network,

00:18:53.833 --> 00:19:01.167
and to treat him, we blocked his memories
and had him dive into Underworld like before.

00:19:01.167 --> 00:19:04.958
But for some reason,
his memories didn't get blocked.

00:19:04.958 --> 00:19:11.583
Kirito was plunged into the Underworld
as Kazuto Kirigaya, his real-world persona.

00:19:11.583 --> 00:19:13.917
W-Wait a second!

00:19:13.917 --> 00:19:20.375
Then he's been living as himself in the Underworld,
where time's accelerated, for how long?

00:19:20.375 --> 00:19:22.583
About two years.

00:19:22.583 --> 00:19:28.958
That's how long Kirito has been interacting
with the artificial Fluctlights of that world.

00:19:28.958 --> 00:19:34.500
Knowing the entire time that they'll all be
destroyed at the end of the current simulation.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:41.292
That's probably why he went to the console in
the Central Cathedral to contact the real world.

00:19:41.292 --> 00:19:47.625
To ask you, Mr. Kiku to protect
all of the Fluctlights.

00:19:47.625 --> 00:19:51.208
And I'm sure it wasn't an
easy thing for him to do.

00:19:51.208 --> 00:19:54.125
But he did make it.

00:19:54.125 --> 00:19:57.167
Since we were under attack,
I couldn't check the logs,

00:19:57.167 --> 00:20:01.833
but it seems like he lost some allies
in the battle against the Axiom Church.

00:20:01.833 --> 00:20:06.542
That's why, when he managed
to get in contact with us,

00:20:06.542 --> 00:20:08.833
he was berating himself harshly.

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:13.500
To put it another way,
he was attacking his own Fluctlight.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:17.833
At that moment,
the men in black cut the power line,

00:20:17.833 --> 00:20:24.042
which caused a short circuit, and the ensuing
surge caused the STL to spike momentarily.

00:20:24.042 --> 00:20:32.750
As a result, Kirito's self-destruction impulse
was actualized and his ego was deactivated.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.167
Ego... deactivated?

00:20:36.167 --> 00:20:38.458
What does that mean?

00:20:38.458 --> 00:20:40.292
Take a look at this.

00:20:40.292 --> 00:20:45.292
Normally, where this black hole is,
what you'd find is, to be precise...

00:20:45.292 --> 00:20:48.792
...the self-image.

00:20:48.792 --> 00:20:54.333
Self-image. One's conception
as determined by the self, you mean?

00:20:54.333 --> 00:20:55.625
That's correct.

00:20:55.625 --> 00:21:01.042
Apparently, all our decision making passes
through a "Yes/No" circuit inside our Fluctlights

00:21:01.042 --> 00:21:05.750
that asks "Should I do this
under these conditions, or not?"

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:11.875
For example, Rinko-<i>senpai</i>, have you ever
ordered a second helping at a beef bowl place?

00:21:11.875 --> 00:21:13.042
I haven't.

00:21:13.042 --> 00:21:17.625
Even if your mind is like, "I want to
have more. I could eat another bowl"?

00:21:17.625 --> 00:21:18.417
That's right.

00:21:18.417 --> 00:21:24.792
So in other words, that was the result
of your self-image circuit processing.

00:21:24.792 --> 00:21:28.792
In Kirito's case,
his Fluctlight is largely unscathed,

00:21:28.792 --> 00:21:32.500
but because the circuit in question
is non-functional,

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.333
all he can do in his current state, most likely,

00:21:35.333 --> 00:21:39.500
is reflexive reactions triggered
by deeply ingrained memories.

00:21:41.333 --> 00:21:45.375
I don't think he knows who he is,
or what it is he needs to do,

00:21:45.375 --> 00:21:47.875
and he can't speak voluntarily.

00:21:47.875 --> 00:21:50.125
I believe that's his current state.

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:52.150
Next time: "The Final Load Test."
